☐  6. Scheduling multiple drones
    ☐ Why is shortest path per drone not enough?
    ☐ Time as a dimension: (zone, turn) states
    ☐ Time-expanded graph (waiting = staying in the same zone next turn)
    ☐ Reservation table (who occupies which zone / connection at which turn)
    ☐ Planning drones one by one vs all together
    ☐ Does the order drones are planned in change the result?
    ☐ Flow-based thinking: how many drones can pass per turn through a bottleneck?
    ☐ Max-flow / min-cut (intuition)
    ☐ How to split drones across paths of different lengths?
    ☐ How to model a restricted connection in time (occupies the link, must arrive next turn)?
    ☐ Conflicts: two drones into the same zone, link over capacity, drones swapping places
    ☐ Deadlocks: how do they happen? How to detect and avoid them?
    ☐ Lower bound: how to compute the theoretical minimum turns for a map?
        ☐ Example: Impossible Dream = entry latency 19 + 24 remaining drones = 43

☐  7. Input parsing and validation
    ☐ Open and read a file safely
    ☐ Read line by line, keep the line number
    ☐ Strip whitespace, skip empty lines
    ☐ Ignore comments (#)
    ☐ Identify the line type (nb_drones, start_hub, end_hub, hub, connection)
    ☐ Parse metadata inside [...]
    ☐ Report errors clearly (line + cause)
    ☐ Custom ParseError
    ☐ Input format
        ☐ nb_drones: <number>
        ☐ start_hub: <name> <x> <y> [metadata]
        ☐ end_hub: <name> <x> <y> [metadata]
        ☐ hub: <name> <x> <y> [metadata]
        ☐ connection: <zone1>-<zone2> [metadata]
    ☐ Validation questions
        ☐ Is the number of drones a positive integer?
        ☐ Exactly one start and one end?
        ☐ Are coordinates integers?
        ☐ Are zone names valid (no dashes, no spaces) and unique?
        ☐ Do connections only use previously defined zones?
        ☐ Are duplicate connections rejected (a-b == b-a)?
        ☐ Are capacities positive integers?
        ☐ Is the zone type one of normal / blocked / restricted / priority?
        ☐ Is max_drones on start/end ignored?
        ☐ Is the metadata syntax valid?
        ☐ Is a map with no path start→end reported (not crashing)?

